ve the base high of $59.92. Volume that day was 4.2M shares, 4.83x the prior 10-day average of 866K. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $73.44, and the chart ends at $60.68.","lesson":"This is an example of a textbook breakout: a base, then a close above it on heavy volume, and it held. This is the pattern the rules are built around."}}